    {
      "kind": "synopsis",
      "source_text": "315プロダクションの記念日を祝う、\nスペシャルライブの開催が決定。\nパッションあふれる最高の舞台にすべく、\nアイドルたちは一丸となって新曲や衣装、\nステージ演出を作り上げていく。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 1
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-1:text",
        "step_id": 1,
        "step_index": 0,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "同胞団よ！　大いなる闇の宴に向けた\n円卓会議を始めようではないか！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 4
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうですね。全員そろいましたし、\nさっそく相談しましょう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ライブの当日に動画を撮って、公式チャンネルに\nアップするんだよね？　すっごく楽しそう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん。撮る内容は俺たちが決めて良いそうだけど、\n何かやってみたいことはあるかい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "動画を見返した時に、ライブ当日のわくわくした\n気持ちを思い出せるようなものがいいですよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだ！　じゃあ本番前に、みんなの楽屋に\n突撃しちゃうっていうのはどう？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "少々慌ただしくはなりそうですが、その様子も含め\n臨場感があっていいかもしれませんね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "試練に挑む悪のシモベたちの姿を、余すことなく\n見せつけようという訳か。クク……悪くない……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "順番に回っていると時間がかかりますし、\n私たち5人で手分けして訪ねるのはどうでしょう？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 20
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それがいいと思うな。誰がどのユニットの\n楽屋に行くか、本番までに分担を考えておこう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 21
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なら、もふもふえんにはあたしが突撃したいな♪\n衣装を着てる姿、ばっちり撮らなくちゃ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 24
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この前、一緒に衣装のことを相談してたよね。\n確かにいいインタビューができるかも。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 25
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "では、分担が決まり次第、プロデューサーさんから\nみなさんに企画のことを伝えてもらいましょうか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
